# The forest beetle's body (#327, D101): the `dead` frame of beetle.grid, pixel for pixel, in a decor-tier palette (D76): muted
# grey-olive with a contour in its own hue, no ink 0b0814, no moon rim, so a harmless body never reads as a live beetle. The game
# draws the active `dead` frame at the kill and cross-fades into this one; it rocks when the hero passes (reactive, not idle).
# Night palette (D92): the shell's own hues mixed toward the night background 2c3f66 and greyed; keep it in step with beetle.grid.
size 24 16
color k 4f5452
color d 59605a
color t 626a60
color s 6e7568
color h 7b786a
color n 545852
color L 6c7068
frame body
